OL,3,GNEWSAFloating bus stop report finds
OL,4,Athey pose 'low risk'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Transport for London (TfL) report on
OL,7,Ffloating bus stops that says they pose
OL,8,F"very low risk" to pedestrians has
OL,9,Fangered disability campaigners.
OL,11,FIn one of three new reports released on
OL,12,FFriday, TfL admitted floating bus stops
OL,13,Fmight deter older and disabled people
OL,14,Ffrom using public transport, but said
OL,15,Fthis proportion was "not statistically
OL,16,Fsignificant".
OL,18,FA floating bus stop, also known as a
OL,19,Fbus stop bypass (BSB), is a road layout
OL,20,Fwhere a dedicated cycle lane runs
OL,21,Fbehind the passenger waiting area,
OL,22,Fseparating it from the main pavement.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
