OL,3,GNEWSAFloating bus stop report finds
OL,4,Athey pose 'low risk'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah Gayton, of the National
OL,7,FFederation of the Blind (NFB), said
OL,8,FBSB's were "absolutely abhorrent" and
OL,9,F"not fit for purpose for all people".
